                                Angular
                                =======

Introduced by Google in 2009. Team leaded by miskey Henry devloped Angular.Previously it was called AngularJS.
Angular uses Model View Controller. It uses JavaScript language. 

React-> Introduced on 2013 by Meta (Facebook) used js/ts. It is a JavaScript library. Componenet type architecture.

Angular 2016->It changed completly to TypeScript. It completly changed Componenet based architecture.

